"""Provider-free production-composition proof for the schema-v3 PIT optimizer.

This is ignored local evidence, not a repository test.  It deliberately uses the
production dispatcher, live-service builder, public run adapter, authorization
ledger, resource ledger, audit trail, artifact store, and candidate lifecycle.
Only provider, policy-worker, and evaluator boundaries are replaced with local
deterministic fakes.
"""

